    prefix=('# Current mission: P12-PREDICTIVE-STRUCTURE-V2\n\nExact scientific BASE c6384a114c1a7ced2045d07edf56545f160508f2. Separate exploratory predictive track; draft complete locally, original M4 failures immutable. All4 primary CA1-DG contrasts fail Holm<=0.05 (smallest0.0693359375). Reused1638 M3 and78 offsets without refit;910 new model cases/21476 unit fits plus21476 necessary identical-endpoint PG certification replays, all strict original-PG/AD gates pass. All104x999 fixed-predictor control cases complete; original M5 not reclassified. Initial preflight/PG-oracle/shared-ACL defects and failed receipts retained and resolved. Final C fitting/D evaluation unexecuted and locked. Archive-only scoped origin/test push/readback/clean gate follows; the external closure receipt binds the final verified commit. STOP after closure; no M4 rescue or final evaluation without separate authorization. Evidence paper12_predictive_v2/MANUSCRIPT.md andops/evidence/2026-10-14/p12-predictive-structure-v2. Entire historical status bytes follow unchanged.\n\n---\n').encode('utf-8')
